    {
      "name": "style",
      "platforms": ["android", "iphone", "ipad", "macos"],
      "summary": "Style of the tabbed bar.",
      "description": "Specify one of the constants:\nFor iOS, one use [Titanium.UI.BUTTON_STYLE_OPTION_POSITIVE](api:Titanium.UI#BUTTON_STYLE_OPTION_POSITIVE) or [Titanium.UI.BUTTON_STYLE_OPTION_NEUTRAL](api:Titanium.UI#BUTTON_STYLE_OPTION_NEUTRAL).\n\nFor Android use [Titanium.UI.TABS_STYLE_DEFAULT](api:Titanium.UI#TABS_STYLE_DEFAULT) or\n[Titanium.UI.TABS_STYLE_BOTTOM_NAVIGATION](api:Titanium.UI#TABS_STYLE_BOTTOM_NAVIGATION) and\nit is only supported in the creation dictionary of the proxy.\n",
